    "Es wurde schwer, sich auf das Ausmaß dessen zu konzentrieren, was geschah, als dieser Name tief in mein Innerstes eindrang und mich mit eisigem Schrecken erfüllte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1244
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_625b466c:

    # "I felt that I might collapse at any moment as blackness crept into my vision."
    "Ich hatte das Gefühl, jeden Moment zusammenzubrechen, als mir Schwärze in die Sicht kroch."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1245
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_422d9dcd:

    # "I started to pray for it, thinking it would be a small mercy to give myself over to the darkness and escape the decimation around me."
    "Ich begann darum zu beten, denn ich dachte, es wäre eine kleine Gnade, mich der Dunkelheit hinzugeben und der Verwüstung um mich herum zu entkommen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1246
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_aef12e9d:

    # "But the adrenaline snapped me awake and forced me to watch as the two squared off."
    "Doch das Adrenalin riss mich wach und zwang mich zuzusehen, wie die beiden sich gegenüberstanden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1247
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_30c39a8f:

    # "The thing glared at him, hatred spewing from its eyes as it became clear the monstrous bogeyman of our childhood {i}recognised him.{/i}"
    "Das Ding starrte ihn wütend an, Hass aus seinen Augen spießend, als klar wurde, dass das monströse Schreckgespenst unserer Kindheit {i}ihn erkannte.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1248
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5b38abb9:

    # DUPREY "{i}After all these years...{/i} Again we face each other!"
    DUPREY "{i}Nach all diesen Jahren...{/i} Wieder stehen wir uns gegenüber!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1250
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_9f3b7d0e:

    # DUPREY "Aye, beasty! So, you DO recognise me!"
    DUPREY "Ja, Biest! Also erkennst du mich DOCH!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1251
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_e5950610:

    # DUPREY " I knew there was a brain behind that thick fucking skull of yours!"
    DUPREY "Ich wusste, dass hinter deinem verdammt dicken Schädel ein Gehirn steckt!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1252
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7d377b6d:

    # "Zanarak turned menacingly towards Captain Duprey, giving him its full attention."
    "Zanarak drehte sich bedrohlich zu Captain Duprey und schenkte ihm seine volle Aufmerksamkeit."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1253
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_ddeb9dfe:

    # DUPREY "Come on then, you fuck! LET’S SEE YOU TRY TO FUCKING KILL ME!"
    DUPREY "Komm schon, du Mistkerl! LASS UNS SEHEN, WIE DU VERSUCHST, MICH UMZUBRINGEN!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1254
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_1c9a8a91:

    # DUPREY "For Newheart! FOR ALDERAYYYYY!"
    DUPREY "Für Newheart! FÜR ALDERAYYYYY!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1255
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_309bf98b:

    # "Lunging forward, the Captain flung himself screaming at the beast, dodging one of Zanarak’s swipes as he brought his mighty axe down on him, slashing at the beast’s ribs with all his strength."
    "Er stürmte vorwärts, der Captain warf sich schreiend auf die Bestie, wich einem von Zanaraks Hieben aus, als er seine mächtige Axt auf ihn niedersausen ließ und mit aller Kraft auf die Rippen der Bestie einschlug."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1256
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c5ac5daf:

    # "Zanarak staggered, the blade had bounced off his flesh and failed to cut him, but it must have hurt."
    "Zanarak taumelte, die Klinge war an seinem Fleisch abgeprallt und hatte ihn nicht geschnitten, aber es musste wehgetan haben."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1257
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_2f8ae10d:

    # "The Captain once again moved to dodge Zanarak’s swishing tail as it smashed into one of the walls, flinging everything still climbing them to the mud and blood beneath."
    "Der Captain wich erneut Zanaraks peitschendem Schwanz aus, als dieser gegen eine der Wände krachte und alles, was noch daran hochkletterte, in den Schlamm und das Blut darunter schleuderte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1258
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_ef64d10d:

    # "Once again lunging forward, Captain Duprey rolled forward to evade the sweeping swing of Zanarak’s spear and leapt up to attack, smashing Zanarak’s face with his axe, causing him to drop the spear."
    "Erneut stürmte Captain Duprey vorwärts, rollte sich vor, um dem ausladenden Schwung von Zanaraks Speer auszuweichen, sprang auf und schlug Zanarak mit der Axt ins Gesicht, sodass dieser den Speer fallen ließ."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1259
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_be32a2be:

    # KIARA "Why doesn’t his axe pierce its flesh?!"
    KIARA "Warum durchdringt seine Axt nicht sein Fleisch?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1260
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b1e2cdd8:

    # MC "I don’t know! It’s hide must be too thick!"
    MC "Ich weiß nicht! Seine Haut muss zu dick sein!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1261
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_8d41be99:

    # "While it staggered, the Captain once again continued a fury of heavy hits, causing Zanarak to fumble backwards, blood dripping down his face from where the axe had managed to pierce through his hard skin."
    "Während er taumelte, setzte der Captain erneut eine Wut schwerer Schläge fort, wodurch Zanarak rückwärts taumelte, Blut lief sein Gesicht hinunter, wo die Axt seine harte Haut durchdrungen hatte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1262
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_906e6a5f:

    # "For a moment, it felt like victory was at hand, that the Captain would overcome Zanarak and save the day."
    "Einen Moment lang fühlte es sich an, als wäre der Sieg nah, dass der Captain Zanarak überwältigen und den Tag retten würde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1263
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_16ea6760:

    # DUPREY "Come on! Is that all you’ve—"
    DUPREY "Komm schon! Ist das alles, was du—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1264
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_d0d64118:

    # "Suddenly, Zanarak charged forward with such speed, he caught the Captain off guard. With one backhand of his claw, he sent the Captain tumbling into the mud."
    "Plötzlich stürmte Zanarak mit solcher Geschwindigkeit vorwärts, dass er den Captain überraschte. Mit einem Rückhandschlag seiner Klaue schickte er den Captain in den Schlamm trudeln."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1265
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_721e4ea2:

    # "Coughing and retching up blood, he moved to grab his axe once again but before he could, Zanarak was on him, knocking the axe away with his foot as he grabbed Captain Duprey with both hands."
    "Hustend und Blut würgend, griff er erneut nach seiner Axt, aber bevor er es konnte, war Zanarak über ihm, stieß die Axt mit seinem Fuß weg und packte Captain Duprey mit beiden Händen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1266
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_e7a8fc89:

    # "Frantically, we continued to fight our way forward through the hordes of Demorai, but were powerless to save him, we could only watch... {i}and despair.{/i}"
    "Verzweifelt kämpften wir uns weiter durch die Horden der Demorai vorwärts, aber waren machtlos, ihn zu retten, wir konnten nur zusehen … {i}und verzweifeln.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1267
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_70a61346:

    # "As Zanarak squeezed the Captain’s body in its claws, there was a terrible snapping and screeching sound as the Captain retched blood out his mouth."
    "Als Zanarak den Körper des Captains in seinen Klauen zusammendrückte, gab es ein schreckliches Knack- und Kreischgeräusch, während der Captain Blut aus dem Mund würgte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1268
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_aab6a330:

    # "Zanarak’s tongue licked its lips in anticipation as a cruel smile crawled across its face. It brought the Captain closer, quivering with excitement."
    "Zanaraks Zunge leckte sich erwartungsvoll die Lippen, während ein grausames Lächeln über sein Gesicht kroch. Es zog den Captain näher, zitternd vor Aufregung."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1269
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b28e6f0b:

    # DUPREY "{i}Fucking... choke on me...{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}Scheiße … erstick an mir …{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1270
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b41bcfd6:

    # DUPREY "{i}YOU CUNT!{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}DU FOTZE!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1271
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7d68f31c:

    # "In one last effort of defiance, the Captain swung his head forward to smash his forehead against Zanarak, causing his own head to bleed in the process as he spat his blood onto Zanarak’s darkly bemused face."
    "In einer letzten Geste des Widerstands schwang der Captain seinen Kopf nach vorne, um seine Stirn gegen Zanarak zu schmettern, wobei sein eigener Kopf blutete, als er sein Blut auf Zanaraks düster amüsiertes Gesicht spuckte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1274
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_47940fd0:

    # "Zanarak, in return, snarled angrily as he crushed the Captain in his powerful taloned hands."
    "Zanarak knurrte wütend, während er den Captain mit seinen mächtigen krallenbewehrten Händen zerquetschte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1276
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_69683e08:

    # "Duprey’s agonising scream almost seemed to satiate him before he plunged his jaw forward and greedily tore him apart in a bloody, violent mess."
    "Dupreys qualvoller Schrei schien ihn fast zu befriedigen, bevor er seinen Kiefer nach vorne stieß und ihn gierig in einem blutigen, gewalttätigen Durcheinander auseinanderriss."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1282
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_64f442b9:

    # "Distantly, I felt Markus’ hand on my shoulder pull me back as the world around me became quiet as a graveyard."
    "Entfernt spürte ich, wie Markus’ Hand mich an der Schulter zurückzog, während die Welt um mich herum so still wie ein Friedhof wurde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1283
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_9a29d94f:

    # "When he spoke, I couldn’t quite hear what he was saying until he shook me violently and sound all seemed to rush back at once."
    "Als er sprach, konnte ich nicht ganz hören, was er sagte, bis er mich heftig schüttelte und der Lärm auf einmal zurückzukehren schien."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1290
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c370ce71:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]! We need to get out of here now!"
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]! Wir müssen jetzt hier raus!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1291
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_4bbe56ad:

    # "Shaking my head fearfully, I turned towards Kiara."
    "Ängstlich den Kopf schüttelnd, wandte ich mich Kiara zu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1293
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_e7d23a00:

    # MC "We have to go!"
    MC "Wir müssen los!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1294
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_2ead6772:

    # "As Kiara battled off some of the Demorai and turned to face me, she suddenly stopped in her tracks with a shudder."
    "Als Kiara einige der Demorai abwehrte und sich zu mir umdrehte, blieb sie plötzlich mit einem Schaudern stehen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1303
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5c962eab:

    # "Peering down in an almost comical confusion she noticed what we all saw happen; a tentacle had thrust its way through Kiara’s chest."
    "In fast komischer Verwirrung nach unten blickend, bemerkte sie, was wir alle sahen: Ein Tentakel hatte sich durch Kiaras Brust gebohrt."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1304
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_8942250d:

    # "I looked at her, and she me, paralysed with terror."
    "Ich sah sie an, und sie mich, vor Schreck wie gelähmt."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1305
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_6e5b7aa8:

    # "With a trail of blood seeping from the side of her mouth, she simply said..."
    "Mit einer Blutspur, die aus ihrem Mundwinkel sickerte, sagte sie einfach ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1306
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_af03a4be:

    # KIARA "{i}Run...{/i}"
    KIARA "{i}Lauf ...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1307
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_4de9edf4:

    # "And with that Kiara was flung backwards into the throes of battle."
    "Und damit wurde Kiara rückwärts in die Wirren der Schlacht geschleudert."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1309
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b1bef907:

    # "Feeling a surge of manic grief, I screamed as I tried to fling myself forward to save her, but Markus used all his strength and held me back."
    "Ein Anflug wahnsinniger Trauer überkam mich, und ich schrie, während ich versuchte, mich nach vorn zu werfen, um sie zu retten, aber Markus setzte all seine Kraft ein und hielt mich zurück."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1310
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_61978aa7:

    # MARKUS "IT’S TOO LATE, SHE’S GONE!"
    MARKUS "ES IST ZU SPÄT, SIE IST VERLOREN!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1311
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_f4e00510:

    # "Determinedly pulling me back, Markus cried..."
    "Entschlossen zog Markus mich zurück und rief ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1312
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_0da52be2:

    # MARKUS "The battle is lost! We have to retreat!"
    MARKUS "Die Schlacht ist verloren! Wir müssen uns zurückziehen!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1313
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_cf98d2a8:

    # MC "We’re surrounded!"
    MC "Wir sind umzingelt!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1314
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_8baa2c55:

    # "Markus looked around wildly, staring back at the entrance to the cavern and pulled me along."
    "Markus blickte wild um sich, starrte zurück zum Eingang der Höhle und zog mich mit."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1315
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_363568e5:

    # MARKUS "Come on! It’s the only way!"
    MARKUS "Komm schon! Es ist der einzige Weg!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1321
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_4170c645:

    # MC "HURRY!"
    MC "BEEIL DICH!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1322
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7ad62c8c:

    # MARKUS "It won’t close!"
    MARKUS "Es schließt nicht!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1323
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_d7589ccf:

    # MC "CLOSE IT! CLOSE THE FUCKING DOOR!"
    MC "MACH SIE ZU! MACH DIE VERDAMMTE TÜR ZU!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1324
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_ef27cd89:

    # MARKUS "I’m trying!"
    MARKUS "Ich versuche es!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1325
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_2cd10d35:

    # MC "MARKUS! HURRY! IT’S NEARLY—"
    MC "MARKUS! BEEIL DICH! ES IST FAST—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1335
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_f00dab72:

    # "Exhausted, caked in dirt and grime, me and Markus looked at each other wearily."
    "Erschöpft, mit Dreck und Schmutz verkrustet, sahen Markus und ich uns müde an."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1336
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_60add535:

    # "The sounds of fighting outside had slowly died down, only an eerie silence was left."
    "Die Kampfgeräusche draußen waren langsam erstorben, nur eine unheimliche Stille blieb zurück."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1337
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_fe368176:

    # "We found ourselves speaking in whispers."
    "Wir ertappten uns dabei, flüsternd zu sprechen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1338
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c55369df:

    # MARKUS "Are we...?"
    MARKUS "Sind wir...?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1339
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_aa0d9848:

    # MC "{i}We’re the only ones left.{/i}"
    MC "{i}Wir sind die einzigen, die übrig sind.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1340
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_69308a51:

    # "The dawning realisation caused the blood to run cold in our veins, slowly we turned to look around at what may be our tomb."
    "Die aufkeimende Erkenntnis ließ das Blut in unseren Adern gefrieren, langsam drehten wir uns um und blickten auf das, was vielleicht unser Grab sein könnte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1341
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_adf58131:

    # "The chamber was unusual."
    "Die Kammer war ungewöhnlich."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1342
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_a845dd1f:

    # "Two strange obelisks stood menacingly in the center of the room."
    "Zwei seltsame Obelisken standen bedrohlich in der Mitte des Raumes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1347
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7f07395e:

    # "One of the perfect pair black, the other white, they looked timeless, ancient."
    "Einer des perfekten Paares war schwarz, der andere weiß, sie wirkten zeitlos, uralt."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1348
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_3e4b9aee:

    # MC "What are those?..."
    MC "Was sind das?..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1350
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_d6fd9fd7:

    # "Reluctantly shifting my gaze to examine the room, I saw tables full of vials and half empty potions."
    "Widerstrebend lenkte ich meinen Blick, um den Raum zu untersuchen, und sah Tische voller Phiolen und halb leerer Tränke."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1351
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_380c3d56:

    # "Various pieces of paper were scattered around the floor — someone had left in a hurry."
    "Verschiedene Papierstücke waren auf dem Boden verstreut — jemand war in Eile aufgebrochen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1352
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_180b3c82:

    # MARKUS "What is this place?"
    MARKUS "Was ist das für ein Ort?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1353
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_0b01172f:

    # MC "I can’t even guess..."
    MC "Ich kann es nicht einmal erraten..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1354
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7f34c1ab:

    # MC "There has to be a way out of here though so, let’s see if we can find some kind of secret exit or something..."
    MC "Es muss hier aber einen Ausweg geben, also lass uns mal sehen, ob wir irgendeinen geheimen Ausgang oder so finden können ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1356
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5e963aa5:

    # MARKUS "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Well, it sure beats waiting around to die..."
    MARKUS "{i}*Seufz*{/i} Nun, das ist auf jeden Fall besser als hier herumzusitzen und auf den Tod zu warten ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1365
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_1490ecb4:

    # "Picking up some of the papers, I tried to piece them together and decipher some of what was going on."
    "Ich hob einige der Papiere auf und versuchte, sie zusammenzusetzen und zu entschlüsseln, was hier vor sich ging."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1366
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_a36fbb89:

    # "{i}‘Subjects remain in petrified state until we can discover a means to try quelling their ‘parasitic’ natures.{/i}"
    "{i}‘Die Subjekte bleiben in versteinertem Zustand, bis wir einen Weg finden, ihre 'parasitären' Naturen zu unterdrücken.’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1367
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_3778fff4:

    # "{i}Neither Kern, Luxma, Burning Wings or Scun seem to have any chemical impact on ‘controlling’ them.’{/i}"
    "{i}Weder Kern, Luxma, Burning Wings noch Scun scheinen irgendeinen chemischen Einfluss auf ihre 'Kontrolle' zu haben.’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1368
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_b2aa7c93:

    # "Hastily scribbled on the bottom was..."
    "Hastig am unteren Rand gekritzelt stand ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1369
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_68192352:

    # "{i}‘All other current botanic ingredients local to Alderay have proven ineffective, requesting more ‘exotic’ ingredients to test with from neighbouring kingdoms.’{/i}"
    "{i}‘Alle anderen derzeitigen botanischen Zutaten, die in Alderay heimisch sind, haben sich als unwirksam erwiesen; es werden weitere 'exotische' Zutaten aus den benachbarten Königreichen zum Testen angefordert.’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1370
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_3ead958e:

    # "{i}‘Just what will it take to get these things under control?’{/i}"
    "{i}‘Was wird es nur brauchen, um diese Dinger unter Kontrolle zu bekommen?’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1371
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_ea56ab57:

    # MC "(What are they talking about?)"
    MC "(Worüber reden sie?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1378
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_fe8092c0:

    # "Slumped down dead against the wall, still in his dark dusty robes, was the body of a Dark Mage clutching at some letter in his hands."
    "Tot an die Wand gelehnt, immer noch in seinen dunklen, staubigen Roben, lag der Körper eines Dunkelmagiers, der einen Brief in seinen Händen umklammerte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1379
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_737d8344:

    # MARKUS "What’s a Dark Mage doing here?"
    MARKUS "Was macht ein Dunkler Magier hier?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1380
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_ecae0ae1:

    # MC "I don’t know..."
    MC "Ich weiß nicht..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1381
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_8143ea13:

    # "Reaching down, I pulled the crumpled letter from the skeleton hands of the Dark Mage."
    "Ich beugte mich hinunter und zog den zerknitterten Brief aus den Skeletthänden des Dunklen Magiers."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1382
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_1c0d9374:

    # "As I did so, some the skeleton's bones disintegrated into ash right before my eyes."
    "Während ich das tat, zerfielen einige Knochen des Skeletts direkt vor meinen Augen zu Asche."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1383
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_aeb74839:

    # "‘Consider this my final gift unto you, {i}my lord{/i}, I die safe in the knowledge that once you retrieve these things, you will finally turn the tide of this war...’"
    "‚Betrachte dies als mein letztes Geschenk an dich, {i}mein Herr{/i}, ich sterbe in der Gewissheit, dass du, sobald du diese Dinge holst, endlich das Blatt dieses Krieges wenden wirst...‘"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1384
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_56e8ecef:

    # "‘But be wary, their power is still highly unstable... Choose only the finest to wield them, for to choose any less would spell {i}disaster{/i} for the realm.’"
    "‚Aber sei gewarnt, ihre Macht ist noch höchst instabil... Wähle nur die Besten aus, um sie zu führen, denn eine weniger gute Wahl würde {i}Unheil{/i} über das Reich bringen.‘"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1385
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_b633e548:

    # "‘Yours faithfully, forever, Kharlof.’"
    "‚In Treue ergeben, für immer, Kharlof.‘"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1386
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_a28c417d:

    # MC "(My lord? Turning the tide of the war? What is he talking about?)"
    MC "(Mein Herr? Das Blatt des Krieges wenden? Wovon redet er?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1393
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_82c068b8:

    # "Inspecting the dust covered tables of potions, I tried reading the dozens of labels on each of the various jars and vials but recognized almost none of the ingredients."
    "Ich inspizierte die staubbedeckten Tische mit Tränken und versuchte, die Dutzenden Etiketten auf den verschiedenen Gläsern und Fläschchen zu lesen, erkannte aber fast keine der Zutaten."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1394
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_03c042eb:

    # MC "What is all this for?"
    MC "Wofür ist das alles?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1396
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_27c7f643:

    # "Markus glanced over the potions and picked one up:"
    "Markus warf einen Blick über die Tränke und nahm einen hoch:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1397
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_9c69b8c3:

    # MARKUS "They were certainly working hard to solve... {i}something{/i}."
    MARKUS "Sie waren sicherlich hart daran, ... {i}etwas{/i} zu lösen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1403
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8c77d8f3:

    # "Apprehensively, the two of us finally made our way over to the obelisks."
    "Besorgt machten wir beide uns schließlich auf den Weg zu den Obelisken."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1404
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3c0f14f6:

    # "As I listened closely, I could almost hear a... {i}a heartbeat?{/i}"
    "Als ich genau hinhörte, konnte ich fast einen ... {i}einen Herzschlag?{/i} hören."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1405
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6256818a:

    # MARKUS "What are these things?"
    MARKUS "Was sind diese Dinger?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1406
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8cac275a:

    # "Feeling a gnawing urge to reach out and touch the monument, I rested my hand on its ice-cold surface."
    "Von einem nagenden Drang erfüllt, die Hand auszustrecken und das Monument zu berühren, legte ich meine Hand auf seine eiskalte Oberfläche."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1408
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f151046e:

    # "I’ve noticed Markus doing the same..."
    "Ich habe bemerkt, dass Markus dasselbe tut ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1409
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1a1e080a:

    # "This alone frightened me, and with a shudder I withdrew my hand just as fast."
    "Allein das erschreckte mich, und mit einem Schauder zog ich meine Hand genauso schnell zurück."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1410
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c246b715:

    # "Markus looked at me, pulling his hand back as well."
    "Markus sah mich an und zog ebenfalls seine Hand zurück."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1411
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_864bdbb5:

    # MARKUS "You okay?"
    MARKUS "Alles okay?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1412
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_81175200:

    # MC "This is weird, I thought—"
    MC "Das ist seltsam, dachte ich—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1416
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8505186f:

    # "Suddenly, both monuments began to illuminate with colorful markings..."
    "Plötzlich begannen beide Monumente mit bunten Markierungen zu leuchten ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1417
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_63884bfb:

    # "We stepped back fearfully, holding out our swords and mustering the remainders of our strength, naively hoping to protect ourselves from whatever dark magic these stones were channeling."
    "Wir traten ängstlich zurück, hielten unsere Schwerter vor uns und sammelten die Reste unserer Kraft, in der naiven Hoffnung, uns vor der dunklen Magie schützen zu können, die diese Steine kanalisierten."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1418
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b13f2d6c:

    # MARKUS "Why did you touch it?!"
    MARKUS "Warum hast du es berührt?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1419
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7f1d5238:

    # MC "I don’t know! I felt I had to—"
    MC "Ich weiß es nicht! Ich hatte das Gefühl, ich müsste—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1423
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5df8b429:

    # "{b}A black mass of slithering tentacles{/b} erupted from the monument I fixed my gaze upon."
    "{b}Eine schwarze Masse aus schlängelnden Tentakeln{/b} brach aus dem Monument hervor, auf das ich meinen Blick geheftet hatte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1424
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4ff3e97c:

    # "Shocked, I instinctively tried to swing my sword at it, only to find my arm firmly locked in place, one of the squirmy limbs coiling tightly around it."
    "Geschockt versuchte ich instinktiv, mein Schwert danach zu schwingen, nur um festzustellen, dass mein Arm fest in Position gehalten wurde, während eines der sich windenden Gliedmaßen sich eng darum wickelte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1425
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_64fdced3:

    # "In an instant, I was engulfed by the dark entity."
    "Im Nu wurde ich von der dunklen Entität verschlungen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1426
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1c5eec72:

    # "Unable to fight it I broke into a desperate struggle, primordial terror clawing its way into my very soul."
    "Unfähig, dagegen anzukämpfen, geriet ich in einen verzweifelten Kampf, während urzeitlicher Schrecken sich in meine Seele krallte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1428
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_31afbfe4:

    # "The last thing I saw was Markus, devoured by a similar abomination bursting out from the second monument..."
    "Das Letzte, was ich sah, war Markus, der von einer ähnlichen Abscheulichkeit verschlungen wurde, die aus dem zweiten Monument hervorbrach ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1429
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6ea3e288:

    # "...only of {i}pure white{/i}."
    "...nur aus {i}reinem Weiß{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1441
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b5509755:

    # "Dark dreams circled in my head..."
    "Dunkle Träume kreisten in meinem Kopf..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1442
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c2ef21b2:

    # "...visions of hundreds of naked women of all the different races I had never seen..."
    "...Visionen von hunderten nackter Frauen aller mir unbekannten Rassen..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1443
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_ac79c46e:

    # "...fawning over me desperately, moaning in intense pleasure as I sat on what seemed like a golden throne..."
    "...die sich verzweifelt an mich schmiegten und in intensiver Lust stöhnten, während ich auf einem scheinbar goldenen Thron saß..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1444
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_15801940:

    # "...storm clouds gathering overhead as lightning forked to the world below..."
    "...Sturmwolken zogen über mir auf, während Blitze zur Welt darunter zuckten..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1459
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7ebda109:

    # "My eyes shot open as I sat bolt upright in horror."
    "Meine Augen schossen auf, und ich ruckte entsetzt kerzengerade hoch."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1460
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c8ca8afa:

    # "Drenched in sweat, I looked around frantically to get some sense of bearing on where I was."
    "Schweißgebadet blickte ich mich panisch um, um irgendeine Orientierung zu bekommen, wo ich war."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1461
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5f8b107a:

    # "I was sitting on one of many rows of beds made up in a stone-cold room."
    "Ich saß auf einem der vielen Bettenreihen, die in einem eiskalten Steinraum aufgereiht waren."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1463
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_af2e3de3:

    # "Looking around I realised I was in... {i}Fort Sebastian?{/i}"
    "Als ich mich umsah, wurde mir klar, dass ich in... {i}Fort Sebastian?{/i} war."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1464
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_06f0eaca:

    # "{i}The medical ward{/i}?"
    "{i}Die Krankenstation{/i}?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1465
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_be4d18bb:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]..."
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1467
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8cd3553f:

    # "I turned my head to look to my side, Markus was leaning on the wall near the next bed, looking even paler than usual, his eyes dark and foreboding."
    "Ich drehte meinen Kopf zur Seite, Markus lehnte an der Wand neben dem nächsten Bett, noch blasser als sonst, seine Augen dunkel und unheilkündend."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1468
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5aaca9bd:

    # "One would think he was on death’s door as he spoke to me."
    "Man könnte meinen, er stünde an der Schwelle des Todes, als er zu mir sprach."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1469
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_dfd2fec5:

    # MC "How did we... {i}get here?{/i}"
    MC "Wie sind wir... {i}hierhergekommen?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1470
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3feec716:

    # MARKUS "I don’t know... The nurses told me..."
    MARKUS "Ich weiß es nicht... Die Krankenschwestern haben mir erzählt..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1471
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_2fb985d3:

    # MARKUS "They found us naked outside the gates."
    MARKUS "Sie haben uns nackt vor den Toren gefunden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1472
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_077ab260:

    # MC "The gates? Are we—"
    MC "Die Tore? Sind wir—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1473
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_64a2f0c8:

    # MARKUS "Yeah... We’re home."
    MARKUS "Ja... Wir sind zu Hause."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1474
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_87b6f681:

    # "Despite my mind being awash with questions, I could at least allow a deep sigh of relief that we had by some miracle survived {i}the horrors of that abandoned fort{/i}."
    "Obwohl mein Verstand vor Fragen überschäumte, konnte ich zumindest einen tiefen erleichterten Seufzer ausstoßen, dass wir wie durch ein Wunder die Schrecken {i}dieses verlassenen Forts{/i} überlebt hatten."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1475
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4b98f3a0:

    # "My mind turned to Captain Duprey, Borras... {i}Kiara...{/i}"
    "Meine Gedanken wanderten zu Captain Duprey, Borras... {i}Kiara...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1476
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_92d4e80e:

    # "I heard a clanking sound approaching and looked towards it."
    "Ich hörte ein klirrendes Geräusch, das näher kam, und blickte in die Richtung."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1477
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_05f226df:

    # "A huge figure walked towards us, accompanied by four heavily armed guards and a beautiful mage."
    "Eine riesige Gestalt kam auf uns zu, begleitet von vier schwer bewaffneten Wachen und einer schönen Magierin."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1479
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7ff991c7:

    # "Naturally, the mage caught my wandering gaze, but just as I managed to focus a familiar, menacing voice opened up..."
    "Natürlich erregte die Magierin meinen wandernden Blick, aber gerade als ich mich konzentrieren konnte, erklang eine vertraute, bedrohliche Stimme ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1481
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_68fb8823:

    # MENACING_VOICE "Check them both."
    MENACING_VOICE "Untersucht sie beide."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1482
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_665817ca:

    # BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "Of course, my lord."
    BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "Natürlich, mein Herr."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1484
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4dbe0bba:

    # "As the mage stepped forward, I could not help but stare at her chest, deep cutout of her robes displaying a fair portion of her breasts."
    "Als die Magierin vortrat, konnte ich nicht anders, als auf ihre Brust zu starren; der tiefe Ausschnitt ihrer Robe zeigte einen ansehnlichen Teil ihrer Brüste."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1485
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5a9888e7:

    # "My heartbeat rose, an unnatural wave of passion caressing my weakened body..."
    "Mein Herzschlag beschleunigte sich, eine unnatürliche Welle der Leidenschaft streichelte meinen geschwächten Körper ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1486
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f72558e8:

    # "She spoke in a soft, raspy voice, pointing her staff at me:"
    "Sie sprach mit sanfter, rauer Stimme und richtete ihren Stab auf mich:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1487
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9e803c89:

    # BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "Hold still."
    BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "Stillhalten."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1493
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_32a24889:

    # "Her staff lit up, warm light following its cryptic tip as she slowly held it over my body, head to toe."
    "Ihr Stab leuchtete auf, warmes Licht folgte seiner geheimnisvollen Spitze, als sie ihn langsam von Kopf bis Fuß über meinen Körper führte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1494
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b4bb5c70:

    # "Markus was next, the procedure seemingly soothing his aching psyche."
    "Markus war der Nächste, die Prozedur schien seine schmerzende Psyche zu beruhigen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1495
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_324b2179:

    # "In a few moments the mage was through examining us."
    "Binnen weniger Augenblicke war die Magierin mit unserer Untersuchung fertig."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1498
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_bbae3533:

    # "Her full, purple lips let out a conclusive mutter, then she spoke up:"
    "Ihre vollen, violetten Lippen gaben ein abschließendes Murmeln von sich, dann sprach sie:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1499
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9d14bd22:

    # BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "They do not possess magic, nor do they reek of any magical essence that shows they have been possessed or tainted by the Demorai’ magic."
    BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "Sie besitzen keine Magie, noch riechen sie nach irgendeiner magischen Essenz, die darauf hindeutet, dass sie besessen oder von der Magie der Demorai' verdorben wurden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1501
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8e787395:

    # MENACING_VOICE "Thank you, Kylisa, you may go now."
    MENACING_VOICE "Danke, Kylisa, du kannst jetzt gehen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1503
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_31cce257:

    # "Kylisa bowed, as she stepped away and left the ward."
    "Kylisa verbeugte sich, trat zurück und verließ das Krankenrevier."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1505
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5c00a2f0:

    # "Emperor Alcott’s attention was fully diverted to us now."
    "Die Aufmerksamkeit von Kaiser Alcott war nun vollständig auf uns gerichtet."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1506
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_32ac97cc:

    # ALCOTT "It is good to see you awake."
    ALCOTT "Es ist gut, euch wach zu sehen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1507
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_dacb22da:

    # ALCOTT "Now then, it’s time you boys told me what the hell happened out there."
    ALCOTT "Nun denn, es ist an der Zeit, dass ihr Jungs mir erzählt, was zum Teufel da draußen passiert ist."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1508
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3c28cd0c:

    # "Clearly still deranged, I questioned if I was still dreaming..."
    "Offensichtlich immer noch verwirrt, fragte ich mich, ob ich noch träumte..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1509
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_efd13d1e:

    # "...or was it indeed Emperor Alcott himself, standing before me and Markus, giving a damn about what we’ve got to say."
    "...oder war es tatsächlich Kaiser Alcott selbst, der vor mir und Markus stand und sich einen Dreck darum scherte, was wir zu sagen haben."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1510
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7daffe81:

    # ALCOTT "... You two deaf?"
    ALCOTT "... Seid ihr zwei taub?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1511
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1e27a783:

    # "I did my best to muster an answer."
    "Ich tat mein Bestes, eine Antwort zu geben."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1512
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_031d7429:

    # MC "I... My lord... I..."
    MC "Ich... Mein Herr... Ich..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1513
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_82c15c63:

    # ALCOTT "Out with it!"
    ALCOTT "Heraus damit!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1514
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_74abaf0e:

    # MC "We reached the fort as instructed, my lord."
    MC "Wir erreichten die Festung wie befohlen, mein Herr."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1515
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_182d39fe:

    # MC "It was abandoned, but we were hit by a huge Demorai force."
    MC "Sie war verlassen, aber wir wurden von einer riesigen Demorai-Streitmacht angegriffen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1516
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_ef36cc08:

    # ALCOTT "How many?"
    ALCOTT "Wie viele?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1517
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_0898c1cf:

    # MC "I don’t know, sir... Hundreds... maybe thousands..."
    MC "Ich weiß nicht, mein Herr... Hunderte... vielleicht Tausende..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1518
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a4e4ae45:

    # ALCOTT "...Hmm..."
    ALCOTT "...Hmm..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1519
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b3696be1:

    # MC "... {i}That thing{/i}... it killed Captain Duprey."
    MC "... {i}Dieses Ding{/i}... es hat Captain Duprey getötet."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1520
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1bddb1d5:

    # ALCOTT "Who? What thing? What are you talking about?"
    ALCOTT "Wer? Was für ein Ding? Wovon redest du?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1521
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b21ba69a:

    # MC "Demorai... Captain Duprey called it {i}Zanarak.{/i} It was there..."
    MC "Demorai... Captain Duprey nannte es {i}Zanarak.{/i} Es war dort..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1522
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_618237ff:

    # "For just a moment, the Emperor’s stoic face cracked as he heard those words, even his armed guards turned to glance at each other, the scent of fear now hanging in the air."
    "Für einen kurzen Moment zeigte das stoische Gesicht des Kaisers einen Riss, als er diese Worte hörte, selbst seine bewaffneten Wachen warfen sich gegenseitig Blicke zu, der Geruch der Angst hing nun in der Luft."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1523
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c69602a0:

    # ALCOTT "I see..."
    ALCOTT "Ich verstehe..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1524
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_346d70be:

    # "After a brief pause, he proceeded:"
    "Nach einer kurzen Pause fuhr er fort:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1525
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d8c65580:

    # ALCOTT "What did you find in the fort? Did you recover anything?"
    ALCOTT "Was haben Sie in der Festung gefunden? Haben Sie etwas geborgen?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1526
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6e12cd42:

    # MC "As I searched for an answer, I suddenly felt the faintest voice in the back of my head whispering something."
    MC "Als ich nach einer Antwort suchte, spürte ich plötzlich die leiseste Stimme im Hinterkopf, die etwas flüsterte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1527
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_ddf0c2d1:

    # "Too distinct to be my own internal thoughts and yet..."
    "Zu deutlich, um meine eigenen inneren Gedanken zu sein, und doch..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1528
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1dd8dbb8:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}No.{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}Nein.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1529
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7849ce3f:

    # MC "... No, sir."
    MC "... Nein, Sir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1530
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_55fad953:

    # "I noticed that Markus had realised I was lying — he quickly looked to hide his expression."
    "Ich bemerkte, dass Markus erkannt hatte, dass ich log – er bemühte sich schnell, seinen Gesichtsausdruck zu verbergen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1531
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_eee1e18d:

    # "The Emperor raised a curious eyebrow."
    "Der Kaiser hob eine neugierige Augenbraue."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1532
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_cb6cfe3e:

    # ALCOTT "{i}‘No’?{/i}"
    ALCOTT "{i}‘Nein’?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1533
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_acc6fa77:

    # MC "Everything inside was destroyed, the Demorai must have reached it long before we did."
    MC "Alles im Inneren war zerstört, die Demorai müssen es lange vor uns erreicht haben."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1534
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7b122b05:

    # "My foggy mind didn’t seem to bother lying straight to Alcott’s face."
    "Mein benebelter Verstand schien keine Probleme damit zu haben, Alcott direkt ins Gesicht zu lügen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1535
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c69602a0_1:

    # ALCOTT "I see..."
    ALCOTT "Ich verstehe..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1536
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5bc491e1:

    # MC "Everyone was killed, we barely made it out alive..."
    MC "Alle wurden getötet, wir sind nur knapp mit dem Leben davongekommen..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1537
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a02226be:

    # "To my own surprise it effortlessly weaved together a story, line after line, of our escape."
    "Zu meiner eigenen Überraschung wob es mühelos, Zeile um Zeile, eine Geschichte unserer Flucht."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1538
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e14fa103:

    # ALCOTT "No survivors?"
    ALCOTT "Keine Überlebenden?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1539
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d1f86cf3:

    # MC "We were the only ones."
    MC "Wir waren die Einzigen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1540
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d8270823:

    # "I felt as if {i}someone else{/i} took over."
    "Ich hatte das Gefühl, dass {i}jemand anderes{/i} die Kontrolle übernommen hatte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1541
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b9c27286:

    # ALCOTT "And how did you two escape exactly?"
    ALCOTT "Und wie seid ihr beiden genau entkommen?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1542
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1a556510:

    # MC "We managed to make a break for it after locking ourselves away in the tunnels, sir."
    MC "Wir konnten uns aus dem Staub machen, nachdem wir uns in den Tunneln verbarrikadiert hatten, Sir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1543
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5742e785:

    # MC "By nightfall they had left the fort, so we made our way back."
    MC "Bei Einbruch der Nacht hatten sie das Fort verlassen, also machten wir uns auf den Rückweg."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1544
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7d7776a6:

    # "Alcott crossed his arms on his chestplate as he slowly paced the next question:"
    "Alcott verschränkte die Arme auf seinem Brustpanzer, während er langsam die nächste Frage stellte:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1545
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9e654f18:

    # ALCOTT "You expect me to believe that you two made a month-long journey through enemy lands..."
    ALCOTT "Ihr erwartet, dass ich glaube, dass ihr beiden eine monatelange Reise durch feindliches Gebiet gemacht habt..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1546
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_44694190:

    # ALCOTT "On foot, alone, injured, starving..."
    ALCOTT "Zu Fuß, allein, verletzt, am Verhungern..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1547
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d485f664:

    # ALCOTT "...{b}In one week?{/b}"
    ALCOTT "...{b}In einer Woche?{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1548
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c22aa46f:

    # "What?..."
    "Was?..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1549
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d7252fc7:

    # MC "A w— It’s only been a week?!"
    MC "Ein W— Es ist erst eine Woche her?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1550
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_92549c50:

    # "Through just the slightest lowering of his eyebrows Alcott betrayed his surprise of my reaction."
    "Durch das geringste Senken seiner Augenbrauen verriet Alcott seine Überraschung über meine Reaktion."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1551
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3303201a:

    # "Seconds later the emotionless mask was back in place."
    "Sekunden später war die emotionslose Maske wieder an ihrem Platz."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1552
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_23bd3c52:

    # ALCOTT "Now give me {i}the truth{/i}."
    ALCOTT "Jetzt gib mir {i}die Wahrheit{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1553
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_718626ed:

    # MC "I... That’s all I can remember."
    MC "Ich... Das ist alles, woran ich mich erinnern kann."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1554
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_cba3c031:

    # ALCOTT "Believe me when I say that you do not want to lie to me."
    ALCOTT "Glauben Sie mir, wenn ich sage, dass Sie mich nicht anlügen wollen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1555
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b4c4b58d:

    # MC "My lord, it is the truth!"
    MC "Mein Herr, es ist die Wahrheit!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1556
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6bbafbe2:

    # MC "I can only remember so much of the journey back."
    MC "Ich kann mich nur an so viel von der Rückreise erinnern."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1557
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_abbd9edb:

    # MC "The rest... If there was anything, it is {i}missing{/i}..."
    MC "Der Rest... Wenn es etwas gab, ist es {i}verschwunden{/i}..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1558
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b9c59d79:

    # "Alcott looked over towards Markus."
    "Alcott sah zu Markus hinüber."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1559
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a5405cc9:

    # ALCOTT "What about you?"
    ALCOTT "Und Sie?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1560
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f83b330e:

    # ALCOTT "Do you have anything to add?"
    ALCOTT "Haben Sie noch etwas hinzuzufügen?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1561
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_efa73dec:

    # "Markus shook his head grimly."
    "Markus schüttelte grimmig den Kopf."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1562
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c6a66cbe:

    # ALCOTT "How inconvenient."
    ALCOTT "Wie ungünstig."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1563
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f8657076:

    # "Alcott took a thoughtful pause, then, as if remembered something, asked:"
    "Alcott hielt eine nachdenkliche Pause, dann, als ob ihm etwas einfiel, fragte er:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1564
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3f6b14d4:

    # ALCOTT "Why were you both naked when we recovered you?"
    ALCOTT "Warum waren Sie beide nackt, als wir Sie bargen?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1565
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_53ac8cdc:

    # MC "I... I don’t know, sir."
    MC "Ich... Ich weiß es nicht, Sir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1566
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_98755bac:

    # MC "Everything is daze, I’m sorry, my lord, it all feels like a nightmare..."
    MC "Alles ist wie im Nebel, es tut mir leid, mein Lord, es fühlt sich alles wie ein Albtraum an..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1567
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_58b51746:

    # ALCOTT "Hmm. I see."
    ALCOTT "Hmm. Ich verstehe."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1568
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a0073a56:

    # ALCOTT "You best hope your memories return swiftly, there are still many questions about what has happened to the Second Scouts."
    ALCOTT "Sie sollten hoffen, dass Ihre Erinnerungen schnell zurückkehren, es gibt noch viele Fragen darüber, was mit den Zweiten Spähern geschehen ist."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1569
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_41fa21ba:

    # ALCOTT "Questions {i}I{/i} want answers to."
    ALCOTT "Fragen, auf die {i}ich{/i} Antworten möchte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1570
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b23d52c3:

    # MC "... I will do my best to remember, my lord."
    MC "... Ich werde mein Bestes geben, mich zu erinnern, mein Lord."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1571
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9e91bd01:

    # "I was convinced that Alcott did not entirely believe my story, but it must have satisfied him enough for now at least."
    "Ich war überzeugt, dass Alcott meine Geschichte nicht gänzlich glaubte, aber es muss ihm zumindest fürs Erste genügt haben."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1572
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_976a04cd:

    # ALCOTT "... In light of the unusual circumstances surrounding the Second Scouts Division and the danger you single-handedly faced along with the losses your unit suffered, you are both hereby relinquished of your duties as Scouts."
    ALCOTT "... Angesichts der ungewöhnlichen Umstände um die Zweite Späherdivision und der Gefahr, der ihr euch allein gestellt habt, sowie der Verluste, die eure Einheit erlitten hat, seid ihr beide hiermit von euren Pflichten als Späher entbunden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1573
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1bf8606f:

    # MC "Sir? You mean—"
    MC "Sir? Ihr meint—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1574
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_fd2f53f3:

    # ALCOTT "HOWEVER, the two of you shall instead sign up to the Adventurer’s Guild."
    ALCOTT "JEDOCH, ihr beide sollt euch stattdessen bei der Abenteurergilde einschreiben."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1575
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3b1d3c63:

    # MC "The... The {i}Adventurer’s Guild?{/i}"
    MC "Die... Die {i}Abenteurergilde?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1576
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_85f508b4:

    # ALCOTT "You are free to live and stay in the Capital unless the city itself falls under siege, upon which you, like all other able bodied, are still bound to heed the call to arms."
    ALCOTT "Ihr dürft frei in der Hauptstadt leben und bleiben, es sei denn, die Stadt selbst wird belagert; in diesem Fall seid ihr, wie alle anderen Wehrfähigen, dennoch verpflichtet, dem Ruf zu den Waffen zu folgen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1577
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_99546b5d:

    # ALCOTT "Elsewise you shall serve the Empire as Guild members instead."
    ALCOTT "Andernfalls sollt ihr dem Imperium stattdessen als Gildenmitglieder dienen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1578
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f0433fc8:

    # ALCOTT "This is offered to you solely on the highly unusual circumstances surrounding your... survival."
    ALCOTT "Dies wird euch allein aufgrund der höchst ungewöhnlichen Umstände angeboten, die euer... Überleben umgeben."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1579
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_2e2bde2d:

    # ALCOTT "You are now far more useful to me alive than dead."
    ALCOTT "Ihr seid mir jetzt lebend weit nützlicher als tot."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1580
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4b45d7d3:

    # ALCOTT "Both of you are forbidden to speak about your mission and its failure to anyone, understand?"
    ALCOTT "Es ist euch beiden verboten, mit irgendjemandem über eure Mission und deren Scheitern zu sprechen, verstanden?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1581
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_623d4f96:

    # "Me and Markus both nodded, giving our best ‘yes, sirs’."
    "Markus und ich nickten beide und gaben unser bestes ‚Jawohl, Sirs‘."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1583
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e69568ef:

    # ALCOTT "In return for this you will both {i}also{/i} be required to help me with... {i}raising morale.{/i}"
    ALCOTT "Im Gegenzug werdet ihr beiden {i}auch{/i} verpflichtet sein, mir bei... {i}der Hebung der Moral{/i} zu helfen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1584
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e35cd6bf:

    # "Both me and Markus just looked at each other, clueless."
    "Markus und ich sahen uns einfach nur an, ahnungslos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1585
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4ef65ac0:

    # MC "... Sir?"
    MC "... Sir?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1586
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1255a968:

    # ALCOTT "As far as anyone is concerned, you two single-handedly and {i}bravely{/i} fought together, slaying dozens of Demorai and returned not as lone survivors, but as {i}heroes{/i}. Understand?"
    ALCOTT "Soweit es irgendjemanden betrifft, habt ihr beide im Alleingang und {i}tapfer{/i} zusammen gekämpft, Dutzende Demorai erschlagen und seid nicht als einsame Überlebende, sondern als {i}Helden{/i} zurückgekehrt. Verstanden?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1587
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5fbe41cb:

    # MC "But—"
    MC "Aber—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1588
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c5ee3b38:

    # ALCOTT "As of now, most of the city is talking about the two surviving heroes."
    ALCOTT "Mittlerweile spricht der Großteil der Stadt von den beiden überlebenden Helden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1589
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_bc98f3ed:

    # ALCOTT "I intend to salvage something out of this affair to help people keep the faith."
    ALCOTT "Ich beabsichtige, aus dieser Affäre etwas zu retten, um den Leuten zu helfen, den Glauben zu bewahren."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1590
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_48409954:

    # ALCOTT "They {b}will not{/b} hear of the massacre that you walked into, that story will die in this room and you two will only speak of the bravery and courage of your comrades."
    ALCOTT "Sie {b}werden nicht{/b} von dem Massaker hören, in das ihr geraten seid, diese Geschichte wird in diesem Raum sterben und ihr beide werdet nur von der Tapferkeit und dem Mut eurer Kameraden sprechen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1591
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a5be7a25:

    # "The Emperor wants us..."
    "Der Imperator will, dass wir..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1592
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_363258d4:

    # "{i}To lie?{/i}"
    "{i}Lügen?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1593
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e0c9d687:

    # ALCOTT "Given the fate you have managed to escape, visiting public places to wave and smile around is not such a bad alternative."
    ALCOTT "Angesichts des Schicksals, dem ihr entkommen seid, ist das Besuchen öffentlicher Orte, um zu winken und zu lächeln, keine so schlechte Alternative."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1594
translate de qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_0650d1f5:

    # ALCOTT "Don’t you agree?"
    ALCOTT "Findest du nicht auch?"

